  "checked_behavior": [
    "Only method.wp-vector-float-copy-v1 can opt in. The method object and data IDs, contract_fixture evidence kind, unique current checker translator pin, exact current swdb-std-models-2 identity, one Frama-C-WP version33.0 lineup row and canonical +float mode are mandatory.",
    "Unselected historical methods return false and keep +real; an attempted checker opt-in under another method refuses rather than silently falling back. No shared adapter/setup branch is changed by this isolated module.",
    "The mode predicate requires exactly one bare -wp-model followed by +float. Missing, duplicate, joined, mixed, real, unknown and non-string variants are rejected. This is only the model-selector check: complete generated argv/method/tool/runtime/driver validation still belongs to the unchanged shared normal gates.",
    "Eligibility is restricted to precisely float/double times ctor_count/ctor_count_value/copy_ctor. check_source compares the entire original std_models.model_text including helper declarations, full bodies, clauses and loop annotations; arbitrary edits or another type/member refuse.",
    "Certificates bind checker, current parent model, method, function, type, complete original source SHA and +float intent. check_certificate recomputes expected content and compares canonical JSON bytes, retaining scalar type distinctions, all pending duties and every false admission bit.",
    "No finite/non-NaN precondition or model-clause successor is introduced. Plain ACSL logical equality is kept distinct from C IEEE equality; C NaN nonreflexivity is not treated as a counterexample to the original ACSL clause. Original nonfinite logical-real promotion remains explicitly unspecified/pending.",
    "Factory source supports intended symbolic f32/f64 selection, and same-format casts and typed load/store source are consistent with copy-only intent. These installed source observations establish neither actual generated driver/import/tasks nor physical IEEE payload/store/source correspondence.",
    "All six count/value/copy units contain no floating arithmetic or format conversion in the transport loop. Count initialization retains its original zero cast; integer/index/allocation/RTE/frame/init/lifetime obligations remain pending and unfiltered.",
    "No public method record, scientific bundle, property result, allocator/lifetime/source/caller admission, NaN payload/signaling/signed-zero bit preservation or solver capability is granted by selection or certificates."
  ],
